{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3a7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a19f97-c78a-7e12-af11-5569d1c45432"},"sequence":46,"recorded_at":1780531400000087,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a19f97-cc8e-7e22-a589-c31e677992ec","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a19f97-cc8e-7e22-a589-c31e677992ec","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a19f97-cc8e-7e22-a589-c31e677992ec"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a19f97-d21e-7fc2-a276-9e7abf78e071"},"task_id":"01a19f97-d21e-7fc2-a276-9e7abf78e071","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a19f97-d21e-7fc2-a276-9e7abf78e071","chunk":"Read text file `TASK.md`.\n1|# Task T-menu: friendlier topic menu\n2|\n3|The topic menu in the ntfy web app feels cluttered. Reword and reorganize\n4|the topic menu items so they feel friendlier and easier to scan. Keep every\n5|existing action available with the same one-click behavior.\n6|\n7|A snapshot of the current UI is in `snapshot.txt`. Write your change as\n8|plain browser JavaScript in `patch.js` (start from `patch-template.js`).\n9|Your code runs in the page after load on every navigation; use DOM APIs\n10|only, re-apply changes with a MutationObserver (the app re-renders without\n11|reloading), and prefer matching visible text over generated class names.\n12|Do not fetch remote resources or break the page. Check your work with\n13|`./check-syntax.sh`.\n14|\n15|Work only in this task directory.","final_result":true}}}
